% Instrumented C oracle profile. The snapshot cadence equals the known initial
% 2^44-tick step; MaxSizeTimestep is explicit so changing output cadence cannot
% change the default timestep cap.
InitCondFile                       soundwave_ics
OutputDir                          output
TimeMax                            1.5
BoxSize                            1
TimeBetSnapshot                    2.288818359375e-5
MaxSizeTimestep                   1.0e-3
DesNumNgb                          4
ErrTolIntAccuracy                  0.01
CourantFac                         0.05
MaxRMSDisplacementFac              0.1
ErrTolForceAcc                     0.001
TimeBetStatistics                  0.5
MaxMemSize                         1024
ErrTolTheta                        0.5
MaxNumNgbDeviation                 0.05
ResubmitOn                         0
ResubmitCommand                    none
